# Fresh-clone line-ending consistency (Windows + macOS).
# Text files normalize to LF in the repo and on checkout, so a fresh clone on
# any platform (including the Mac's first clone) never materializes CRLF that
# would break EOL-fragile parsers/tests. Companion to E-005 (the EOL-agnostic
# frontmatter regex); together they defuse the CRLF landmine at the source and
# at the point of use.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep genuinely-binary assets untouched (belt-and-suspenders; main has none of
# these today, but this prevents accidental normalization if any are added).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.onnx binary
